\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces From interaction to targeted training and transfer. Agent M observes its partners, infers their preferences, plans a response, and acts to create new observations. We select game slices (colored nodes and paths) and solve them with an oracle to supervise action selection, inference, and planning given a correct inference. These objectives train a shared model with GRPO. We then evaluate transfer to meeting coordination, where agents use private calendars and exchanged messages to agree on meeting times.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{From interaction to targeted training and transfer. Agent M observes its partners, infers their preferences, plans a response, and acts to create new observations. We select game slices (colored nodes and paths) and solve them with an oracle to supervise action selection, inference, and planning given a correct inference. These objectives train a shared model with GRPO. We then evaluate transfer to meeting coordination, where agents use private calendars and exchanged messages to agree on meeting times}{figure.1}{}}
